{"seq":2,"slug":"stcs-lcs-twcs","title":"STCS/LCS/TWCS 压实策略选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/cassandra-distributed-storage/compaction-storage/stcs-lcs-twcs","wordCount":2640,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"stcs-lcs-twcs-压实策略选择\">STCS/LCS/TWCS 压实策略选择</h1><p>压实是 Cassandra 里唯一一个&quot;不选就会出事&quot;的参数。它的任务是把多个 SSTable 合并成一个,顺便丢弃被覆盖的旧版本、被墓碑标记的数据和已过期的 TTL 记录。听起来是个纯后台的内务工作,但压实策略的选择直接决定三件事:<strong>磁盘会不会写满、读延迟会不会翻倍、后台 I/O 会不会拖垮线上写入</strong>。选错的典型时间线是:上线时一切正常 → 三个月后磁盘使用率异常高 → 半年后读延迟开始上翘 → 一年后运维被迫做一次全量重建。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>压实的一切取舍都是三种放大的交换:<strong>写放大</strong>(一次逻辑写入最终产生多少物理写入)、<strong>读放大</strong>(一次读要查多少个 SSTable)、<strong>空间放大</strong>(磁盘上的数据量除以逻辑数据量)。三者不可能同时最小,只能选一个你最缺的牺牲另外两个。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;压实策略选择&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;数据有 TTL / 时间窗吗?&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| TWCS[&quot;TWCS:按时间窗分桶,过期数据整体清除&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| C{&quot;读多写少,还是写多读少?&quot;}&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;读多写少&quot;| LCS[&quot;LCS:分层归并,读放大最低&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;写多读少&quot;| STCS[&quot;STCS:大小相似合并,写放大最低&quot;]&#10;  LCS --&gt; D[&quot;代价:高写放大,需预留 50% 空闲磁盘&quot;]&#10;  STCS --&gt; E[&quot;代价:高空间放大,SSTable 数无上界&quot;]&#10;  TWCS --&gt; F[&quot;代价:窗口设错则读写双输&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"压实策略选择\"] --&gt; B{\"数据有 TTL / 时间窗吗?\"}\n  B --&gt;|\"是\"| TWCS[\"TWCS:按时间窗分桶,过期数据整体清除\"]\n  B --&gt;|\"否\"| C{\"读多写少,还是写多读少?\"}\n  C --&gt;|\"读多写少\"| LCS[\"LCS:分层归并,读放大最低\"]\n  C --&gt;|\"写多读少\"| STCS[\"STCS:大小相似合并,写放大最低\"]\n  LCS --&gt; D[\"代价:高写放大,需预留 50% 空闲磁盘\"]\n  STCS --&gt; E[\"代价:高空间放大,SSTable 数无上界\"]\n  TWCS --&gt; F[\"代价:窗口设错则读写双输\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>写放大</th>\n<th>读放大</th>\n<th>空间放大</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n<th>磁盘预留</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>STCS</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>高(文件数无上界)</td>\n<td>最高(可达 2×)</td>\n<td>写密集、读少、无 TTL</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LCS</td>\n<td>最高(每层重写)</td>\n<td>最低(≤ 层数)</td>\n<td>最低(约 1.1×)</td>\n<td>读多写少、更新频繁</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TWCS</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低(依赖 gc)</td>\n<td>时序、TTL、按时间窗追加</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"stcs-默认但常被误用\">STCS:默认但常被误用</h2><p>SizeTieredCompactionStrategy 的逻辑最直白:把大小相近的 SSTable 归为一组(官方文档的判据是&quot;an SSTable is added to a bucket if the SSTable size is greater than 50% of the average size of that bucket&quot;),<strong>组内文件数达到 <code>min_threshold</code>(默认 4)时合并成一个</strong>。因为合并的是相近大小的文件,写放大接近最优(每个字节平均被重写 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 次左右)。（来源：Apache Cassandra 官方文档 — Size-Tiered Compaction Strategy, <a href=\"https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/managing/operating/compaction/stcs.html\">https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/managing/operating/compaction/stcs.html</a> ）</p>\n<p>它的致命弱点在<strong>空间放大和文件数</strong>上。STCS 只看大小不看内容重叠度,所以一个分区的更新版本可能散落在多个合并组里,互不重叠的文件无法合并。结果是:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"STCS 的空间放大&#10;  同一条记录被更新 N 次（跨越 N 次 flush）&#10;  → 若这些版本落在不同的合并组，墓碑/旧版本会长期共存&#10;  → 最坏情况磁盘占用 = 2 × 逻辑数据量&#10;  这就是官方建议预留 50% 磁盘的原因\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>STCS 的空间放大</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  同一条记录被更新 N 次（跨越 N 次 flush）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 若这些版本落在不同的合并组，墓碑/旧版本会长期共存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 最坏情况磁盘占用 = 2 × 逻辑数据量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  这就是官方建议预留 50% 磁盘的原因</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p>补充说明:官方 STCS 页面本身只强调 major compaction 需要&quot;new and old SSTables 同时存在&quot;的空间,并明确建议不要对 STCS 做 major compaction;50% 预留是社区与运维文档里流传最广的经验值,并非官方文档给出的硬性数字。（来源：Apache Cassandra 官方文档 — STCS, <a href=\"https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/managing/operating/compaction/stcs.html\">https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/managing/operating/compaction/stcs.html</a> ）</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>STCS 还有一个不常被提到的问题:<strong>没有&quot;大文件&quot;上限</strong>。持续写入的表会不断产生越来越大的合并结果,最终出现一个远超其他文件的巨型 SSTable,而它几乎不可能再与任何文件合并(因为找不到大小相近的伙伴)。此时表的读性能就锁死在那批中小文件上了。</p>\n<p>STCS 的正确适用面比想象中窄:<strong>写入量稳定、读取很少、数据不过期、且能接受 2 倍磁盘占用</strong>。日志类、审计类、写入后几乎不再读的场景适合。任何&quot;数据有生命周期&quot;或&quot;读很频繁&quot;的表都不该用 STCS——而 Cassandra 的默认策略恰好是 STCS,这就是为什么很多集群在建模初期没选策略、半年后出问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lcs-读的最优解与写的代价\">LCS:读的最优解与写的代价</h2><p>LeveledCompactionStrategy 借鉴了 LSM 树的经典分层思想:文件被组织成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0, L_1, L_2, \\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span> 多层,<strong>每一层内部的分区键范围互不重叠</strong>,层数每增加一级容量扩大 10 倍(<code>sstable_size_in_mb</code> 默认 160MB,<code>fanout_size</code> 默认 10)。（来源：Apache Cassandra 官方文档 — Leveled Compaction Strategy, <a href=\"https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/managing/operating/compaction/lcs.html\">https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/managing/operating/compaction/lcs.html</a> ）</p>\n<p>这个&quot;层内不重叠&quot;的性质是 LCS 的全部价值所在。因为同一层里一个分区只可能存在一个文件里,一次读在最坏情况下只需要每层查一个文件——官方文档的表述是&quot;If a read operation needs to access a row, it will only need to look at one SSTable per level&quot;:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>读放</mtext><msub><mtext>大</mtext><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mtext>层数</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mtext>的文件数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">读放大_{LCS} \\approx 层数 + L_0 的文件数</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">读放</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">大</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">层数</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的文件数</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是刚 flush 出来的小文件集合,它的文件数由 <code>L0</code> 的写入速率决定。这就是为什么 <strong>LCS 的读延迟稳定且可预测</strong>,也是它对读密集应用几乎是唯一正确选择的原因。</p>\n<p>代价是写放大极高。从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下沉到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时,系统必须取出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中与待下沉文件范围重叠的<strong>全部文件</strong>,合并后重写。因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的容量是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的 10 倍,这个重写量可能是原始写入的近 10 倍。对写密集表用 LCS,后果是后台 I/O 打满、写入延迟飙升、压实永远追不上。</p>\n<p>LCS 的调参要点:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"sstable_size_in_mb      → 每层单文件大小（默认 160MB），调大减少文件数但增加合并粒度&#10;fanout_size             → 层容量倍数（默认 10），调大减少层数但增加单次合并量&#10;L0 的兜底机制            → L0 不是&quot;层内不重叠&quot;的，文件数超过 32 时会触发一次 STCS 压实（failsafe）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>sstable_size_in_mb      → 每层单文件大小（默认 160MB），调大减少文件数但增加合并粒度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fanout_size             → 层容量倍数（默认 10），调大减少层数但增加单次合并量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>L0 的兜底机制            → L0 不是\"层内不重叠\"的，文件数超过 32 时会触发一次 STCS 压实（failsafe）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>最后一行值得展开:<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是刚 flush 出来的小文件集合,它并不满足&quot;层内不重叠&quot;,因为 memtable 刷盘时无法保证互不重叠。官方文档给出的兜底是&quot;An STCS compaction will be triggered in L0 if there are more than 32 SSTables in L0&quot;(引导 bootstrap 期间也只在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 跑 STCS)。这个机制的目的是在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 堆积时避免读性能崩坏——表现为&quot;写入变慢&quot;时,应该先看 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是否堆积,而不是盲目加节点。（来源：Apache Cassandra 官方文档 — LCS, <a href=\"https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/managing/operating/compaction/lcs.html\">https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/managing/operating/compaction/lcs.html</a> ）</p>\n<h2 id=\"twcs-时序数据的正确答案\">TWCS:时序数据的正确答案</h2><p>TimeWindowCompactionStrategy 是为&quot;按时间追加 + 有 TTL&quot;这一模式专门设计的。它把数据按时间窗分桶(比如一天一个窗),<strong>同一个窗内的文件用 STCS 合并,不同窗之间不合并</strong>。这个简单的规则带来两个巨大收益:</p>\n<p><strong>收益一:过期数据可以被整体清除。</strong> 因为一个时间窗内的数据全部在同一个(或少数几个)SSTable 里,当 TTL 到期且超过 <code>gc_grace_seconds</code> 后,整个 SSTable 可以被直接删除而不需要读取归并。这是 TWCS 最核心的价值——官方文档的表述是&quot;It can drop entire SSTables when they expire, so disk space can be reclaimed much more reliably than when using STCS or LCS&quot;。（来源：Apache Cassandra 官方文档 — TWCS, <a href=\"https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/managing/operating/compaction/twcs.html\">https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/managing/operating/compaction/twcs.html</a> ）</p>\n<p><strong>收益二:写入路径完全顺序化。</strong> 新数据总是落在最新的时间窗,不会与历史窗口的文件合并,所以压实的 I/O 只集中在最近的几个窗口上。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE metrics (&#10;  host_id text,&#10;  bucket  date,          -- 分区键里的时间桶，与 TWCS 窗口对齐&#10;  ts      timestamp,&#10;  value   double,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY ((host_id, bucket), ts)&#10;) WITH compaction = {&#10;  &#39;class&#39;: &#39;TimeWindowCompactionStrategy&#39;,&#10;  &#39;compaction_window_unit&#39;: &#39;DAYS&#39;,&#10;  &#39;compaction_window_size&#39;: 1&#10;} AND default_time_to_live = 7776000;   -- 90 天\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  host_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bucket  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分区键里的时间桶，与 TWCS 窗口对齐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ts      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   double,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((host_id, bucket), ts)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compaction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'class'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TimeWindowCompactionStrategy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'compaction_window_unit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DAYS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'compaction_window_size'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> default_time_to_live </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 7776000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 90 天</span></span></code></pre></div><p>TWCS 有一个必须满足的前提条件,违反它会毁掉整张表的性能:<strong>时间窗的大小必须与数据保留周期相匹配,且数据写入必须大致按时间顺序</strong>。具体是两条经验规则:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"TWCS 窗口设置规则&#10;  规则 1：窗口数不宜过多（建议 &lt; 30，最多 &lt; 50）&#10;    → 100 个窗口意味着 100+ 个 SSTable 同时可读，读放大失控&#10;  规则 2：TTL 至少是窗口大小的若干倍（建议 &gt;= 窗口 × 窗口数）&#10;    → 窗口 1 天、TTL 3 天 → 只有 3 个窗口，但过期清理不频繁&#10;    → 窗口 1 天、TTL 365 天 → 365 个窗口，读放大严重&#10;  反模式：窗口 = 1 小时、TTL = 5 年 → 文件数爆炸\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>TWCS 窗口设置规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  规则 1：窗口数不宜过多（建议 &#x3C; 30，最多 &#x3C; 50）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 100 个窗口意味着 100+ 个 SSTable 同时可读，读放大失控</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  规则 2：TTL 至少是窗口大小的若干倍（建议 >= 窗口 × 窗口数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 窗口 1 天、TTL 3 天 → 只有 3 个窗口，但过期清理不频繁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 窗口 1 天、TTL 365 天 → 365 个窗口，读放大严重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  反模式：窗口 = 1 小时、TTL = 5 年 → 文件数爆炸</span></span></code></pre></div><p>官方文档给出的目标与规则 1 一致:&quot;choose a unit/size combination that produces approximately 20-30 windows&quot;;<code>compaction_window_unit</code> 默认 <code>days</code>、<code>compaction_window_size</code> 默认 <code>1</code>。TTL 侧的建议是&quot;If writing with a 90 day TTL, for example, a 3 Day window would be a reasonable choice&quot;。（来源：Apache Cassandra 官方文档 — TWCS, <a href=\"https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/managing/operating/compaction/twcs.html\">https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/managing/operating/compaction/twcs.html</a> ）</p>\n<p>另一个反模式是<strong>乱序写入</strong>。如果数据的时间戳不单调(例如历史数据回填、或客户端时钟回拨),新写入会落在旧窗口里,而 TWCS 不会跨窗口合并,于是旧窗口会积累大量小文件且永远无法清除。官方文档把这类问题的成因写成&quot;data is comingled in the memtables and flushed into the same SSTable, where it will remain comingled&quot;,并同样点名读修复可能&quot;pull old data into the current memtable&quot;。<strong>TWCS 表必须保证写入时间大致递增</strong>,回填历史数据应该直接写进对应的旧窗口并在完成后手工触发该窗口的压实。（来源：Apache Cassandra 官方文档 — TWCS, <a href=\"https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/managing/operating/compaction/twcs.html\">https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/5.0/cassandra/managing/operating/compaction/twcs.html</a> ）</p>\n<h2 id=\"策略切换与实操判断\">策略切换与实操判断</h2><p>压实策略可以随时用 <code>ALTER TABLE ... WITH compaction = {...}</code> 改动,但<strong>切换不是免费的</strong>:新策略只影响后续的压实,已有文件保持原样,直到被新策略选中参与合并。因此从 STCS 切到 LCS 后,需要一段时间(可能几天)才能看到读延迟改善。</p>\n<p>判断&quot;该不该换策略&quot;有一条可操作路径:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"诊断顺序&#10;  1. nodetool tablestats &lt;ks&gt;.&lt;table&gt;&#10;       → 看 SSTable count 与 &quot;Average live cells per slice&quot;&#10;  2. 若 count 持续 &gt; 100 且写入不密集 → 换 LCS&#10;  3. 若 count 高但磁盘使用率也高（&gt; 1.5 × 逻辑量）→ 换 LCS&#10;  4. 若数据有 TTL 且读取以&quot;最近 N 天&quot;为主 → 换 TWCS（同时确认分桶与窗口对齐）&#10;  5. 若写入吞吐是第一约束、读极少 → 保持 STCS 并监控文件数上限\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>诊断顺序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1. nodetool tablestats &#x3C;ks>.&#x3C;table></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       → 看 SSTable count 与 \"Average live cells per slice\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2. 若 count 持续 > 100 且写入不密集 → 换 LCS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3. 若 count 高但磁盘使用率也高（> 1.5 × 逻辑量）→ 换 LCS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  4. 若数据有 TTL 且读取以\"最近 N 天\"为主 → 换 TWCS（同时确认分桶与窗口对齐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  5. 若写入吞吐是第一约束、读极少 → 保持 STCS 并监控文件数上限</span></span></code></pre></div><p>有一个经验阈值值得记住:<strong>当&quot;读一个 slice 平均触及的 SSTable 数&quot;(<code>Average SSTable count per read</code>)超过 10 时,读延迟已经开始付出可见代价;超过 30 时,即使调整其他参数也无法挽回。</strong></p>\n<p>最后,压实的资源控制参数与策略选择同等重要:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"compaction_throughput_mb_per_sec   → 压实带宽上限（默认 64MB/s），调高会挤占线上 I/O&#10;concurrent_compactors              → 并发压实任务数（未设置时按核数与磁盘数推导，下限 2 上限 8），SSD 可调高&#10;compaction_large_partition_warning_threshold_mb → 大分区告警阈值（4.x 默认 100MB；5.0 起被 guardrails 取代且默认关闭）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>compaction_throughput_mb_per_sec   → 压实带宽上限（默认 64MB/s），调高会挤占线上 I/O</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>concurrent_compactors              → 并发压实任务数（未设置时按核数与磁盘数推导，下限 2 上限 8），SSD 可调高</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>compaction_large_partition_warning_threshold_mb → 大分区告警阈值（4.x 默认 100MB；5.0 起被 guardrails 取代且默认关闭）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>（来源：<code>cassandra.yaml</code> 的 <code>compaction_throughput: 64MiB/s</code> 与 <code>concurrent_compactors</code> 注释, <a href=\"https://github.com/apache/cassandra/blob/cassandra-5.0/conf/cassandra.yaml\">https://github.com/apache/cassandra/blob/cassandra-5.0/conf/cassandra.yaml</a> ;4.0 默认值 <code>compaction_large_partition_warning_threshold_mb: 100</code>, <a href=\"https://github.com/apache/cassandra/blob/cassandra-4.0/conf/cassandra.yaml\">https://github.com/apache/cassandra/blob/cassandra-4.0/conf/cassandra.yaml</a> ;5.0 弃用说明见 NEWS.txt, <a href=\"https://github.com/apache/cassandra/blob/trunk/NEWS.txt\">https://github.com/apache/cassandra/blob/trunk/NEWS.txt</a> ）</p>\n<p>调高 <code>compaction_throughput_mb_per_sec</code> 能缩短压实落后于写入的时间,但代价是线上读写的 I/O 被挤压。在云盘环境里,这个值应该按实际可用的 IOPS/带宽设置,而不是照搬默认值——<strong>把压实带宽设得比磁盘实际能力还高,只会让所有请求一起变慢</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>压实是三种放大的交换:写放大(STCS 最低)、读放大(LCS 最低)、空间放大(LCS 最低、STCS 最高),不存在三者同时最优的策略。</li>\n<li>STCS 是默认策略但适用面窄:写密集、读少、无 TTL、可接受 2 倍磁盘占用。文件数无上界是它的固有弱点。</li>\n<li>LCS 依靠&quot;层内分区范围不重叠&quot;把读放大压到约等于层数,是读密集应用的正确答案;代价是极高的写放大,以及 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 堆积时会主动限流写入。</li>\n<li>TWCS 把时间窗内文件合并、跨窗口不合并,使过期数据可以被整体删除,是 TTL/时序数据的正确答案;前提是窗口数与 TTL 匹配、写入时间大致递增。</li>\n<li>改策略不是免费的:只影响后续压实,需要一段时间才见效;从 STCS 切 LCS 后可能几天才看到读延迟改善。</li>\n<li>判断依据是 <code>nodetool tablestats</code> 的 SSTable 数量与&quot;读一个 slice 平均触及文件数&quot;;后者 &gt; 10 已有代价,&gt; 30 不可挽回。</li>\n<li><code>compaction_throughput_mb_per_sec</code> 必须按磁盘实际能力设置,过量设置的后果是全请求变慢而非压实更快。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>压实减少的是文件数,而读路径上还有三个直接决定&quot;查一个文件要多久&quot;的组件——见 <a href=\"bloom-key-cache\">布隆过滤器、键缓存与压缩</a>;如果发现文件数居高不下的根因是分区设计,应回到 <a href=\"../query-driven-modeling/partition-cluster-keys\">分区键/聚簇键与宽行设计</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"STCS/LCS/TWCS 压实策略选择","id":"stcs-lcs-twcs-压实策略选择"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"STCS:默认但常被误用","id":"stcs-默认但常被误用"},{"level":2,"text":"LCS:读的最优解与写的代价","id":"lcs-读的最优解与写的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"TWCS:时序数据的正确答案","id":"twcs-时序数据的正确答案"},{"level":2,"text":"策略切换与实操判断","id":"策略切换与实操判断"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Memtable、SSTable 与写路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/cassandra-distributed-storage/compaction-storage/sstables-memtables"},"next":{"title":"布隆过滤器、键缓存与压缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/cassandra-distributed-storage/compaction-storage/bloom-key-cache"}}